{
 "_doc": "Forest set piece, round 4 (ADR-0053), tier 1, wilderness pool (site forest on a ridge, or summit): an unmanned microwave relay hut the Cordon used to pass its orders on. Route: the shelter door's can chime -> the hall and the relay schedule -> the bunk room (the signals team: ambush on its door) -> the equipment room -> the generator room (the hikers: ambush on entering; the jaws at the tower foot wake them too) -> out the back door, through the compound's open gate -> up the guyed tower by four real ladders, platform by platform (2x2 kit rooms with open railing edges) -> the top platform: the dishes, the radio, Reyes's log and the battery room key -> back down -> the battery room's steel door (deadbolt, key; a shotgun on its wire inside) -> Reyes (guardian) and the signals cache (loot) -> the bolted yard door out. Hollowed don't climb ladders: the tower is a refuge. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
